      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The diagnosis of secundum atrial septal defect often is delayed. For 310 patients with hemodynamically significant secundum atrial septal defect undergoing closure over a 5-year period at a single medical center, this study reviews the symptoms prompting referral, limitations of physical examination and electrocardiography, and basis for initially missing the diagnosis."
      },
